<title>PARAGUAY: Paraguay inflation 1.9 pct in February.</title>
<headline>Paraguay inflation 1.9 pct in February.</headline>
<dateline>ASUNCION 1997-03-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>Paraguayan inflation rose 1.9 percent in February, up from 1.7 percent in February 1996, the central bank reported Monday.</p>
<p>Inflation in January 1997 was 0.9 percent.</p>
<p>Inflation over the last 12 months slowed to 7.6 percent, down from 11.2 percent in the period a year earlier.</p>
<p>((--Jose Maria Amarilla, Asuncion Newsroom, 595 21 444527/8))</p>
